[Options]

[Init]
<$Config,vn_ally=1>
<$Config,vn_post=1>

[A.]

<p>The Lord of <?{vn_windall}>Wind</?><?!{vn_windall}>Rain</?>~. has recognised your speed on the battlefield.
 ~I"Use this outpost"~N he says ~I"You will be at the front line of our attack."~N he booms to you
 ~I"It will be a great honour to die for the high fury of <?{vn_windall}>Wind</?><?!{vn_windall}>Rain</?>~.." </p>
~[Ioutpost.*]
<p>~NA little worried about this last statement, you nonetheless set off to the scene of your probable demise. 


$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestDead]
~IYou feel the raw power flowing through your veins as the sacrifice is completed. 
Your mind clears, as if a curtain was lifted and you find yourself with the power of new knowledge.
$Menu= ~[IsunFence.1],tell,fence
[fence]
<$GetTechnology,136>

[ai3PriestDead]
~I"You will die"~. screams your defeated opponent ~I"I will come back from hell to destroy your soul"~. 
You laugh as your opponent curses you. As you turn away you feel a prescence as the fury of <?{vn_windall}>Wind</?><?!{vn_windall}>Rain</?>~. grants you your new technology
<?{vn_windall}>$Menu= ~[IwindAviary.1],tell,devil</?>
<?!{vn_windall}>$Menu= ~[IrainAviary.1],tell,mano</?>

[devil]
<$GetTechnology,139>

[mano]
<$GetTechnology,143>

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
"Hey" shouts the freelance priest of sun, "I'm gonna die here if you don't give me a hand!"

[ai4PriestCaptured]
"Help" pleads the freelance priest of sun, "I'm too important to die", "You gotta help me!"

[ai4PriestSaved]
"Thanks for that" "I was nearly a dead man there" remarks the freelance priest of sun "have some storm to show my gratitude"
<$ChangeMoney,5000>

[ai4PriestDead]
As your ally unwillingly decends to the depths of hell, you hear his last words carried across the wind. "A Curse upon you, o useless ally of mine. May your brain rot in your skull and cockroaches feast upon your entrails!"

[ai1PriestCaptured]
"This wasn't supposed to happen", you think to yourself. "Maybe the freelance priest of sun will save me" you think..."On the other hand, maybe not......."
 


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Victory!</h2>
<p>you have survived this confontation and emerged more knowledgable than before.<?{vn_ally}>
 You also saved your ally from a terrible end</?><?!{vn_ally}> Unfortunately your ally was killed in battle</?></p>
<$Config,vn_donevn3=1></?>
<?{windall}><$Config,vn_tech="windBattery;windArcher;outpost;sunFence;windAviary;"></?>
<?!{windall}><$Config,vn_tech="rainBattery;rainCannon;outpost;sunFence;rainAviary;"></?> 
<?{vn_ally}><$Config,vn_donevn3withally=1></?>
<?!{vn_ally}><$Config,vn_donevn3withoutally=1></?>
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,<?{vn_ally}>vn6</?><?!{vn_ally}>vn5</?>

[Failed]
<h2>Failure</h2>
<p>Everything goes black as the sacrifice is complete.

<$Config,vn_death=1>
<$Config,vn_alive=0>
$Button=Leave,tell,guidevn.overview
[END]
